{"entries":[[2006,"enquête","noun",4,"/ɑ̃.kɛt/","f",[1611,"Fr-enqu%C3%AAte.ogg.mp3"],[["inquest, investigation, examination","",[],[],[["Plusieurs mois se passèrent, puis cet homme, ayant été appelé à la questure, laissa glisser cette lettre à terre. Un gendarme la saisit et la présenta au juge qui tomba en arrêt sur les mots : intentions meurtrières, pris une autre route, réfugiés, capturés, Lombardo. Le paysan fut emprisonné, interrogé, mis au secret. Il n'avoua rien. On le garda et une enquête sévère fut ouverte.","Several months passed. Then this man, having been appointed to a collectorship, threw away the letter. A policeman picked it up and presented it to a judge, who immediately fell upon these words: \"Murderous intentions, taken another route, found refuge, captured, Lombardo. The peasant was imprisoned, questioned, almost tortured. He knew nothing. They kept him imprisoned, and a severe examination was begun.",""]]],["survey, inquiry","",[],[],[["C'est justement parce que cette douceur a été nécessaire pour enfanter la douleur — et reviendra du reste la calmer par intermittences — que les hommes peuvent être sincères avec autrui, et même avec eux-mêmes, quand ils se glorifient de la bonté d'une femme envers eux, quoique, à tout prendre, au sein de leur liaison circule constamment, d'une façon secrète, inavouée aux autres, ou révélée involontairement par des questions, des enquêtes, une inquiétude douloureuse.","It is precisely because this comfort has been necessary to bring grief to birth—and will return moreover at intervals to calm it—that men can be sincere with each other, and even with themselves, when they pride themselves upon a woman's kindness to them, although, taking things all in all, at the heart of their intimacy there lurks continually in a secret fashion, unavowed to the rest of the world, or revealed unintentionally by questions, inquiries, a painful uncertainty.",""]]]],{"plural":"enquêtes"},["enquête de satisfaction"],""],[4696,"enquêter","verb",4,"/ɑ̃.kɛ.te/","",[3973,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-enqu%C3%AAter.wav.mp3"],[["to investigate","",[],[],[]],["to survey","",[],[],[]]],{"infinitive":"enquêter","auxiliary":"avoir","present_participle":"enquêtant","past_participle":"enquêté","present":["enquête","enquêtes","enquête","enquêtons","enquêtez","enquêtent"],"imperfect":["enquêtais","enquêtais","enquêtait","enquêtions","enquêtiez","enquêtaient"],"future":["enquêterai","enquêteras","enquêtera","enquêterons","enquêterez","enquêteront"],"conditional":["enquêterais","enquêterais","enquêterait","enquêterions","enquêteriez","enquêteraient"],"subjunctive":["enquête","enquêtes","enquête","enquêtions","enquêtiez","enquêtent"]},[],["Les gendarmes avaient enquêté, mais dans cette boue, la trace se referme comme sur de l'eau. Personne ne savait rien."]],[7679,"enquérir","verb",3,"/ɑ̃.ke.ʁiʁ/","",[6464,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-enqu%C3%A9rir.wav.mp3"],[["to inquire (about = de)","",["pronominal"],["se renseigner sur","s'informer de","enquêter sur"],[]]],{"infinitive":"enquérir","auxiliary":"être","present_participle":"s'enquérant","past_participle":"enquis","present":["m'enquiers","t'enquiers","s'enquiert","nous enquérons","vous enquérez","s'enquièrent"],"imperfect":["m'enquérais","t'enquérais","s'enquérait","nous enquérions","vous enquériez","s'enquéraient"],"future":["m'enquerrai","t'enquerras","s'enquerra","nous enquerrons","vous enquerrez","s'enquerront"],"conditional":["m'enquerrais","t'enquerrais","s'enquerrait","nous enquerrions","vous enquerriez","s'enquerraient"],"subjunctive":["m'enquière","t'enquières","s'enquière","nous enquérions","vous enquériez","s'enquièrent"]},[],["Sa première idée fut de s'enquérir au premier passant du logis du maréchal d'Ancre.","Je n'ai besoin de personne pour pleurer mes fils avec moi. Adieu, ne vous enquérez plus de moi. Mon sort à venir n'appartient plus qu'à moi et à Dieu."]],[9096,"enquêteur","noun",3,"/ɑ̃.kɛ.tœʁ/","m",[7615,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-enqu%C3%AAteur.wav.mp3"],[["investigator","",[],["détective"],[["Near-synonym: détective","",""]]]],{"plural":"enquêteurs","feminine":"enquêtrice"},[],""],[17803,"enquiquiner","verb",2,"/ɑ̃.ki.ki.ne/","",[14270,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-LoquaxFR-enquiquiner.wav.mp3"],[["to annoy; to pester","",["slang","transitive"],["agacer","casser les pieds","embêter","énerver","ennuyer","emmerder","faire chier","importuner"],[["Ah, ils m'enquiquinent, sortir du bain pour les Petites Sœurs des Pauvres ou quoi ?","",""]]]],{"infinitive":"enquiquiner","auxiliary":"avoir","present_participle":"enquiquinant","past_participle":"enquiquiné","present":["enquiquine","enquiquines","enquiquine","enquiquinons","enquiquinez","enquiquinent"],"imperfect":["enquiquinais","enquiquinais","enquiquinait","enquiquinions","enquiquiniez","enquiquinaient"],"future":["enquiquinerai","enquiquineras","enquiquinera","enquiquinerons","enquiquinerez","enquiquineront"],"conditional":["enquiquinerais","enquiquinerais","enquiquinerait","enquiquinerions","enquiquineriez","enquiquineraient"],"subjunctive":["enquiquine","enquiquines","enquiquine","enquiquinions","enquiquiniez","enquiquinent"]},[],""],[25317,"enquiquineur","noun",1,"/ɑ̃.ki.ki.nœʁ/","m","",[["pain, pain in the ass, pain in the neck","",[],[],[]]],{"plural":"enquiquineurs","feminine":"enquiquineuse"},[],["Et puis l'enquiquineur avait hurlé : — Tu veux mon poing dans la gueule ou quoi ?","– Une enquiquineuse qui promenait sa réputation de vertu comme d'autres brandissent des étendards."]],[36818,"enquiquinement","noun",1,"/ɑ̃.ki.kin.mɑ̃/","m","",[["nuisance","",[],[],[]]],{"plural":"enquiquinements"},[],["C'est un enquiquinement mineur mais ça m'embête quand même beaucoup.","Pour éviter tout enquiquinement avec la gendarmerie, je respecte toujours le code de la route.","Autre enquiquinement : j'ai reçu une convocation du juge Nowalski, qui veut m'entendre en tant que témoin."]],[55245,"enquête de satisfaction","noun",0,"/ɑ̃.kɛt də sa.tis.fak.sjɔ̃/","f","",[["sa